  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Believing the guest is married to Spartak defender Makeev, Chef Barinov happily fries the tartare and asks the waiter to wish her husband luck in tomorrow's big match. Meanwhile, when Vika asks why Max did not fly to Cyprus with Sasha, Max impulsively lies that Kostya's grandfather passed away.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И передай от шеф-повара удачи мужу в завтрашнем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А я смотрю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "А откуда ты знаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Между прочим, я сам отказался лететь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А что по этому поводу думает Саша?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А что Саша?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С Сашей у меня как бы все.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А я не мог.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Горе случилось, дед умер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Нет, у Кости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "У тебя?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Надо было помочь другу, саму понимаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да, конечно.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И передай от шеф-повара удачи мужу в завтрашнем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And pass along good luck from the head chef to her husband tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А я смотрю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "А откуда ты знаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how do you know about that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Между прочим, я сам отказался лететь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, I refused to fly myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А что по этому поводу думает Саша?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what does Sasha think about that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А что Саша?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What about Sasha?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "С Сашей у меня как бы все.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things between Sasha and me are basically over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "А я не мог.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just could not go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Горе случилось, дед умер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A tragedy happened, his grandfather died.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Нет, у Кости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, Kostya's grandfather.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "У тебя?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yours?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Надо было помочь другу, саму понимаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had to support pal, you understand, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да, конечно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, of course.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
