    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That wraps up this scene as chef Barinov gladly fries the tartare thinking the guest's husband plays for Spartak, and Max lies to Vika that he skipped Cyprus because Kostya's grandfather died. Until next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
